{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":289598,\"title\":\"Stagecoach to Monterey\",\"tagline\":\"MURDERERS UNMASKED!...In a bursting blaze of breakneck battles...and thrill-a-minute triumphs!\",\"overview\":\"Barstow and Stevens are forcing the local printer to print fake silver certificates which they then sell. Treasury Agents Chick Weaver and Throckmorton Snodgrass arrive working under cover. But when Chick's true identity as an Agent is revealed, Barstow sends his henchmen to finish him off.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/26hRMXmxkh81udSSNGTxakctJov.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rDYS6Vdx3Vc7RJWZzriOJeunlCY.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1944,\"runtime\":55,\"genres\":[\"Western\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Lesley Selander\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":130325,\"name\":\"Lesley Selander\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7iJa6w1AkYk2L72YR0QjbJrVI3C.jpg\"},{\"id\":120807,\"name\":\"Allan Lane\",\"character\":\"Bruce Redmond/Chick Weaver\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fjkAyBItp9uxVZmEVKQUffSlpPv.jpg\"},{\"id\":170804,\"name\":\"Peggy Stewart\",\"character\":\"Jessie Wade\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3PTICRoRcTsyk3cuNmKL5hSVkwQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":120779,\"name\":\"Wally Vernon\",\"character\":\"Throckmorton 'Other-Hand' Snodgrass\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wnXCcliBr24vHdqUazrIXdDVQb1.jpg\"},{\"id\":1276502,\"name\":\"Twinkle Watts\",\"character\":\"Inky Wade\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2ymgaVtP756PTlEUttlDFEZn22I.jpg\"},{\"id\":932309,\"name\":\"Tom London\",\"character\":\"Chester Wade\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nfLW8J3AMasTu1Ahm0HftRgx9qy.jpg\"},{\"id\":89010,\"name\":\"LeRoy Mason\",\"character\":\"Black Jack Barstow\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dlehlwCQHB1wE2V8Ctfrn4Y78k7.jpg\"},{\"id\":33969,\"name\":\"Roy Barcroft\",\"character\":\"J. Rodney Stevens\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/57EKCVAOfcNKNNcHBtkmp0cU9od.jpg\"},{\"id\":100918,\"name\":\"James Mitchell\",\"character\":\"Cave Henchman (uncredited)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pTg0eUWpaJM5p9ReskQhS2axmgM.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":68718,\"title\":\"Django Unchained\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7oWY8VDWW7thTzWh3OKYRkWUlD5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2oZklIzUbvZXXzIFzv7Hi68d6xf.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With the help of a German bounty hunter, a freed slave sets out to rescue his wife from a brutal Mississippi plantation owner.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6977,\"title\":\"No Country for Old Men\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6d5XOczc226jECq0LIX0siKtgHR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fCCvn3xsG29TGKJPvZgTRppsDgk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Llewelyn Moss stumbles upon dead bodies, $2 million and a hoard of heroin in a Texas desert, but methodical killer Anton Chigurh comes looking for it, with local sheriff Ed Tom Bell hot on his trail. The roles of prey and predator blur as the violent pursuit of money and justice collide.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Thriller\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":281957,\"title\":\"The Revenant\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ji3ecJphATlVgWNY0B0RVXZizdf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hEQYZq2CDB2LSJVxxlazdBOKeyW.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the 1820s, a frontiersman, Hugh Glass, sets out on a path of vengeance against those who left him for dead after a bear mauling.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":273248,\"title\":\"The Hateful Eight\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jIywvdPjia2t3eKYbjVTcwBQlG8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7g1zO5t0bd27Iqn5ZUDJmksOGPJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Bounty hunters seek shelter from a raging blizzard and get caught up in a plot of betrayal and deception.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9023,\"title\":\"Spirit: Stallion of the Cimarron\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bBEkKDQFianNYwGWR7gJfPVakmG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b8hPBW0NJmiIVzvQjT3CwIpAdzl.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Against impossible odds, Spirit, a young mustang, sets out across the majestic wilderness to regain his freedom and save his homeland. Along the way, he forms a friendship with a young Lakota brave, outwits a squadron of soldiers, and ultimately, finds love.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":44896,\"title\":\"Rango\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A5MP1guV8pbruieG0tnpPIbaJtt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mOtKQlXdL5J4lwqcSFlkZmgmFeZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Rango, a lost family pet, accidentally winds up in the gritty, gun-slinging Western town of Dirt, the theater-loving lizard suddenly finds himself the newly appointed sheriff. Welcomed as the last hope the town has been waiting for, Rango is forced to play his new role to the hilt and uncover the truth behind a looming water crisis—before his act catches up with him.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":333484,\"title\":\"The Magnificent Seven\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ezcS78TIjgr85pVdaPDd2rSPVNs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4qxZJRYe4ezA5J1sidnV7vuaYaz.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Looking to mine for gold, greedy industrialist Bartholomew Bogue seizes control of the Old West town of Rose Creek. With their lives in jeopardy, Emma Cullen and other desperate residents turn to bounty hunter Sam Chisolm for help. Chisolm recruits an eclectic group of gunslingers to take on Bogue and his ruthless henchmen. With a deadly showdown on the horizon, the seven mercenaries soon find themselves fighting for more than just money once the bullets start to fly.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":188161,\"title\":\"A Million Ways to Die in the West\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1fhAJzhzlaHYAPqiKZN5ap7d5PE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5ZDM988DfYLFPBqy4CNvQ9AXnp4.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As a cowardly farmer begins to fall for the mysterious new woman in town, he must put his new-found courage to the test when her husband, a notorious gun-slinger, announces his arrival.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":537996,\"title\":\"The Ballad of Buster Scruggs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/voxl654m7p36y8FLu8oQD7dfwwK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/12RXkIWUXwOHXgAmlxJNIWRGrri.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Vignettes weaving together the stories of six individuals in the old West at the end of the Civil War. Following the tales of a sharp-shooting songster, a wannabe bank robber, two weary traveling performers, a lone gold prospector, a woman traveling the West to an uncertain future, and a motley crew of strangers undertaking a carriage ride.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":338766,\"title\":\"Hell or High Water\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ljRRxqy2aXIkIBXLmOVifcOR021.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rmPx82V79OetmdWDkyw1gyED6OE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A divorced dad and his ex-con brother resort to a desperate scheme in order to save their family's farm in West Texas.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":44264,\"title\":\"True Grit\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tCrB8pcjadZjsDk7rleGJaIv78k.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5dwlH8Krm2bsuc2Pubw2cBb03g5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following the murder of her father by a hired hand, a 14-year-old farm girl sets out to capture the killer. To aid her, she hires the toughest U.S. Marshal she can find—a man with 'true grit'—Reuben J. 'Rooster' Cogburn.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Adventure\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":939659,\"title\":\"The Adventures of Sheriff Kid McLain\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ulpKlYLSjS5QdAcAjt9DIZYiTnf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young boy journeys to the old west to help the local sheriff defend his town from a villainous gang of outlaws.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"1HEjio50phQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"RyrHiQlsDfU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ogTUXX_cQfQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}